      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768226027266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 12043,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768226031999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I can certainly look into that for you. Can I get your name and order number to start?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768226033999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Jane Doe. Order is VF54321.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 12043,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768226040333332
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Jane. I'm pulling that up... I see the VeloBand Pulse HR Monitor, delivered 28 days ago. To get started, what specifically is the issue with the band? Is it a technical fault or more of a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768226042333332
    },
    {
      "text": "It works fine. I just changed my mind.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 12043,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768226056533332
    },
    {
      "text": "I see. So you just don't use it as much as you had expected?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768226059266665
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah. It was an impulse buy and I really don't use it.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 12043,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768226063466665
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand completely. Let me just pull up the policy for that item... one moment please.",
