      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768226073533331
    },
    {
      "text": "For a simple preference change, we sometimes direct customers to our official VeloFit resale marketplace, but since you're unfortunately outside the 10-day window, I can approve a full refund.",
