      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 12043,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768226092799997
    },
    {
      "text": "Not at all. I've just emailed a prepaid return label to the address on file. Just pack the VeloBand in its original box, apply the label, and drop it at any post office. Once our warehouse receives it, the refund will process in 3-5 business days.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
